!Site Feedback

We very much appreciate you letting us know what you think of this site!  To inform us of problems on the site, or to request new information or changes, please [mailto:request@lojban.org|send us e-mail at request@lojban.org] or use the lojban.org [http://www.lojban.org/rt/|Request Tracker].  You can log in as guest (password "guest") to enter tickets.

!General Feedback

For feedback or questions on other issues related to Lojban, please [mailto:lojban@lojban.org|send us e-mail at lojban@lojban.org].

!Contacting The Logical Language Group, Inc.

